  {
   "id": "bendy-and-the-ink-machine-28311@1.5.1.2",
   "gameId": "bendy-and-the-ink-machine-28311",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 1.5.1.2",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-25T05:24:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi Everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks everyone for sending reports of bugs or things that needed adjustments, and even suggestions. We've pushed the latest hotfix now which includes the following updates:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Hotfox v1.5.1.2",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Player can now move while using the Seeing Tool",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed FPS cap when vsync is off",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved many Null References between loading chapters",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Remove Saving while in Chapter Select (Chapter Select does not save your progress, use Continue instead)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated several floating models and decals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed several light sources that were on when they should be off",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed several mode clipping or z-fighting issues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed soft lock spot in Chapter 3 where the player can get stuck",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed many Null References when using the Lift in Chapter 3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor update to prop texture",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed soft lock spot in Chapter 5 where the player can get stuck",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Update collision where the player can clip through models in various areas",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Re-added missing Lost Ones in Chapter 5 ending area",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "While we were in there we did a few other adjustments and fixes that are super minor. It's been a good 6 years or so since we've done any updates to the game so it's been an interesting experience going back in time. Maybe we'll do it again sometime soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bendy Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
