  {
   "id": "bendy-and-the-ink-machine-28311@major-2024-10-24",
   "gameId": "bendy-and-the-ink-machine-28311",
   "displayName": "Quality of Life Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-24T03:30:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have been able to work on some much needed bug fixes as well as some minor adjustments throughout the game. While we were at it we decided to have some Halloween fun and include some spookiness to Bendy's universe. Ink Demon's Eve runs from October 23-31 every year.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch Notes for v1.5.1",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Updated the Chapter 2 Flooded Stairs Lever to become active sooner",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added ability to skip the JDS Logo on launch",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a \"Toggle Run\" option",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Slightly Increased weapon range and attack radius",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Significantly reduced the length of the Chapter 5 Harbor Battle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed the Store Button from the main menu (you can go to bendymerch.com though!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated the credits with Co-Creator Mike Desjardins",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed several null references from spamming in the background",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added some spooky stuff for Halloween",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a Halloween dedicated achievement",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "With assistance from chazaswag, who helped locate issues in the code",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed Sammy's name on his Audio Log",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Chapter 4 Audio Log achievement",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Chapter Select button from becoming disabled",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Save Glitch where no OnFileWriteEvent event was being cleared",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Volume settings not being applied at start",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Chapter 3 Ending Elevator Softlock",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Workaround Fix for Chapter 5 Weak Plank Softlock",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added chazaswag to the credits",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bendy and the Ink Machine no longer supports Linux, Mac, or Windows 32-bit. So this update will not take place on those platforms. However your game should still run as it was in v1.5, If you're having any trouble you can always revert back to v1.5 by right clicking the game in your Steam library, going to Properties... and selecting the Betas tab.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Bendy Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
